AX5_AqMbucaDRiWZ4cd2tzLYJFsJK0QGYLwVNMEuFJoQ&oe=6A60A604"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "467916352871409", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003282_467916356204742_1871921057092171900_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PHaJ55mO0AEQ7kNvwGiBs0Y&_nc_oc=AdoUlsndz6X3HITwLXIYhht_Qt0VBmhC00zXKSysxKD6CL8SttFHAj6k6vQnpcYPPaI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBLdCa3ZYBF90dKe8LwYFAVsEKcjau4QnRFXP5SrPOTqQ&oe=6A60C2E2"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "1934382610375855", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974473_1934382613709188_7156337812617042679_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=If7Sg9b1r7gQ7kNvwE7q6Kc&_nc_oc=AdoIBWr9rXfccuJXtHjd-f53HGx8jgo45GYSEwqss1CrVhLu761GJQ_PEYC5f2P3Rok&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDO6tYc4EYhCgd5KMTJtO2q_CgYb6hyjdf2_sYw1EfpNA&oe=6A60ACF3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "landscape.png", "id": "1524760081483769", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974531_1524760084817102_6497712644828891067_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kLNFM-SprAcQ7kNvwGF_9gq&_nc_oc=AdpoYB9Cg3xA-kE8dZGpZS9S9-8dfxby-slVDq1s0t_Iqo7xPpFMHjDXflAXOhb1fPY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQD0C32hf8Yt4lryBYuHK_vsIbJv-w73ENy92ch7JZhdqQ&oe=6A60ABEF"}, "display_name": "Mystery Box VR: Hidden Secrets", "keywords": [], "long_description": " AN IMMERSIVE VR PUZZLE EXPERIENCE\nInteract with objects, handles, buttons, and wheels on each side. Crack enigmas and collect hidden puzzle tiles on a random side of the boxes.\n\nYou won't be able to compare reality with fiction.\n\n# DISCOVER INVENTIONS\nOnce you unlock all 8 boxes of a Level Pack, you can compose a puzzle and discover a brief history of an invention.\n\nIt's not always easy to escape the room, so use all your IQ to crack the riddles. There's a logic behind all of them, even where it seems it's not!\n\n# IMMERSIVE SOUNDTRACK\nPlay the game with your headphones to get immersed in this amazing adventure.\n\n# HINTS\nGot stuck on some enigma? No worries, you can still get a helpful hint! You can also get in touch with me in case you really can't make it through a riddle, I'll be glad to help ;)\n\n# MULTILANGUAGE\nAvailable in English, French, Italian, German, Spanish, Russian, and Japanese.\n\nThe game language will change automatically based on the language settings of your device", "short_description": "A VR escape room game where you have to solve intriguing riddles to open boxes and discover nice stories about popular inventions!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "$R36BSY5.png", "id": "3678762505771822", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031430_3678762509105155_2151975047074617165_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tnE8cRUZho0Q7kNvwEUAm4F&_nc_oc=Adr9Q7fQcCn-fNYnfcfs7ATJqatIsFyR1NzoSglm_rxCrIsxLwU9wibyvcynIevW0YI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBiDO7ZPqcliAu3hs2A5EyuPvxb2Ir65F4OcNZBUmypQg&oe=6A60A7E5"}, {"file_name": "$R81V725.png", "id": "2720695481426567", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262743_2720695484759900_604086922326600035_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=inT74WQNhQkQ7kNvwGPYvkO&_nc_oc=Adp3xHg91MnZnNzO0A4GkaMVXOSwLJPdtqT3qPnG-3L6Er12NxkmrNpcuCQ37lzMitE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBGKprEBx9kUEIPg1TDVqoq0fxhw6lC8776SKGDqf9uTQ&oe=6A60A6CD"}, {"file_name": "$RQ3SN6U.png", "id": "1552311425628973", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982519_1552311428962306_1218130395049083834_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=81BrDIPtdqUQ7kNvwFzGgut&_nc_oc=AdrcyeUmhqOaqMoKCR9pvXFqm49lBYbYG3gERfmKFPSKCKUapiLs7eX6jRPiMKSNjog&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=